        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Independent mobility, normal-pace gait, and transfers without assistance. Able to complete basic ADLs at home more slowly than usual and needs rests. Safe to mobilise in the room; mildly symptomatic on rapid standing, improving with a pause."
      }
